# What the release archive carries. The in-app updater downloads `bagholder-vX.Y.Z-web.zip`, which is
# this repository at the tag, and copies every file in it into the app folder — so anything here that
# the running app does not need is bytes every user downloads on every update, and a file written
# into their install for no reason. The tour alone is 14.5 MB of an archive whose app is about 1.5.
docs/ export-ignore
tests/ export-ignore
ios/ export-ignore
android/ export-ignore
.github/ export-ignore
.gitattributes export-ignore
.gitignore export-ignore
MOBILE.md export-ignore
